{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bee-z Factory is a farm based colony-sim, where your goal is to provide guidance to a species of highly temperamental space colonizers called sproutlings, that find themselves stranded on a isolated solar system. Help them to survive, and uncover mysteries of this planet that looks strangely familiar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/mini_bee.png?t=1744830422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Starting with only your bare hands, harvest the local flora, learn new technologies and build highly advanced machinery that will help you build your way out of this planet.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/chopping.gif?t=1744830422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take advantage of whateaver resource you can find, create complex machinery and build your own self-sufficient colony.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Produce!</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/crops.gif?t=1744830422\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resources are presented in nature as finite, it is up to you to find a way of automating their production in a self-sustained colony.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/housing.gif?t=1744830422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nature is hostile, so seek shelter and protect yourself! Build anything you desire, from simple villages o highly advanced cities, all while providing comfort to your sproutlings.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/seasons.gif?t=1744830422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nature is in contant change, all seasons come packed with their own set of challenges, adapt and survive them all!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/planets.gif?t=1744830422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do no settle! Exploration is highly rewarded. While you study ways of getting out of this isolated system, explore neighboring planets in search for resources and answers.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/mini_crops.png?t=1744830422\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1744830422\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374790?t=1744830422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374790?t=1744830422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/0963cf22291b11e56e535a3b6dc18b3faec9c8b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744830422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374790/0963cf22291b11e56e535a3b6dc18b3faec9c8b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744830422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bee-z Factory is a farm based c